# Diagnostics
```
invalid-01.jsx:7:7 lint/correctness/noBeforeInteractiveScriptOutsideDocument ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

  × Don't use next/script component with the `beforeInteractive` strategy outside of pages/_document.js.
  
     5 │   return (
     6 │     <div>
   > 7 │       <Script
       │       ^^^^^^^
   > 8 │         src="https://example.com/script.js"
   > 9 │         strategy="beforeInteractive"
  > 10 │       ></Script>
       │       ^
    11 │     </div>
    12 │   )
  
  i The beforeInteractive strategy only works when the script is loaded from the custom document. Anywhere else, the script does not load before the page becomes interactive.
  
  i Move this script to pages/_document.js, or use a different strategy such as afterInteractive.
  
  i See the Next.js docs for more details.
  

